"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>特に気になる物はないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't see anything all that interesting here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

